    "detailed_description": "<u><i>Evolutionary breeding loop VRRPG &quot;Untrue New World&quot;</i></u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This World Part 1 : Pixie</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Let's raise a cute little creature called a pixie.<br></li><li>Pixies become stronger and evolve depending on how they are raised.<br></li><li>It's okay if a pixie dies, you can re-grow a new one.<br></li><li>If you think you have failed to raise a pixie, you can discard it for free.<br></li><li><strong>Everything about Pixie is at your disposal. </strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This World Part 2 : The City</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For some reason, many pixies have left the city.<br></li><li>Bring back the pixies that have left the city by any means necessary.<br></li><li>The more prosperous the city, the more useful it becomes.<br></li><li>If there are any pixies in town that you don't need, please contact us at any time.<br></li><li><strong>Everything in the city is at your disposal. </strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This World Part 3 : Justice</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Let's follow justice and defeat evil.<br></li><li>Justice will never be killed. You can start over again and again.<br></li><li>Anything that stands in the way of justice becomes evil.<br></li><li>If it is justice, nothing else matters.<br></li><li><strong>All of justice is at your disposal. </strong></li></ul><br><u><i>&quot;This is merely a story in which you are deceived by justice, the world, and me.&quot;</i></u>",
    "about_the_game": "<u><i>Evolutionary breeding loop VRRPG &quot;Untrue New World&quot;</i></u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This World Part 1 : Pixie</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Let's raise a cute little creature called a pixie.<br></li><li>Pixies become stronger and evolve depending on how they are raised.<br></li><li>It's okay if a pixie dies, you can re-grow a new one.<br></li><li>If you think you have failed to raise a pixie, you can discard it for free.<br></li><li><strong>Everything about Pixie is at your disposal. </strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This World Part 2 : The City</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For some reason, many pixies have left the city.<br></li><li>Bring back the pixies that have left the city by any means necessary.<br></li><li>The more prosperous the city, the more useful it becomes.<br></li><li>If there are any pixies in town that you don't need, please contact us at any time.<br></li><li><strong>Everything in the city is at your disposal. </strong></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About This World Part 3 : Justice</h2>.<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Let's follow justice and defeat evil.<br></li><li>Justice will never be killed. You can start over again and again.<br></li><li>Anything that stands in the way of justice becomes evil.<br></li><li>If it is justice, nothing else matters.<br></li><li><strong>All of justice is at your disposal. </strong></li></ul><br><u><i>&quot;This is merely a story in which you are deceived by justice, the world, and me.&quot;</i></u>",
